"| `-fno-tree-loop-unswitch` | Disable loop unswitching |\n"
"| `-ftree-loop-unswitch` | Enable loop unswitching |\n"
"| `-fno-tree-loop-ivcanon` | Disable canonicalization of loop induction variables |\n"
"| `-ftree-loop-ivcanon` | Enable canonicalization of loop induction variables |\n"
"| `-fno-tree-loop-nest` | Disable loop nest optimizations |\n"
"| `-ftree-loop-nest` | Enable loop nest optimizations |\n"
"| `-fno-tree-loop-linear` | Disable linear loop transformations |\n"
"| `-ftree-loop-linear` | Enable linear loop transformations |\n"
"| `-fno-tree-loop-ch` | Disable loop header copying |\n"
"| `-ftree-loop-ch` | Enable loop header copying |\n"
"| `-fno-tree-loop-versioning` | Disable loop versioning |\n"
"| `-ftree-loop-versioning` | Enable loop versioning |\n"
