msgstr "`None` or NPU stream identifier"

msgid "指定 NPU stream。"
msgstr "Specify the NPU stream."

msgid "launch meta-parameter"
msgstr "launch meta-parameter"

msgid "**编译 Pass**"
msgstr "**Compilation Pass**"

msgid "`enable_linearize`"
msgstr "`enable_linearize`"

msgid "版本相关"
msgstr "Version-related"

msgid "启用或禁用 linearization pass。"
msgstr "Enable or disable the linearization pass."

msgid "**CV 融合/layout**"
msgstr "**CV Fusion/Layout**"

msgid "`enable_nd2nz_on_vector`"
msgstr "`enable_nd2nz_on_vector`"

msgid "默认 `False`"
msgstr "Default `False`"

msgid "启用或禁用 Vector 路径上的 ND 到 NZ 布局转换。"
msgstr "Enable or disable the ND-to-NZ layout conversion on the Vector path."

msgid "**大 grid 优化**"
msgstr "**Large Grid Optimization**"

msgid "`auto_blockify_size`"
msgstr "`auto_blockify_size`"

msgid "默认 `1`"
msgstr "Default `1`"

msgid "启用或禁用 AutoBlockify pass。未设置 `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL` 时忽略。"
msgstr "Enable or disable the AutoBlockify pass. Ignored when `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL` is not set."

msgid "launch meta-parameter 或 `triton.Config`"
msgstr "launch meta-parameter or `triton.Config`"

msgid "**编译模式**"
msgstr "**Compilation Mode**"

msgid "`compile_mode`"
msgstr "`compile_mode`"

msgid "`\"unstructured_in_simt\"`（默认）、`\"simd\"`、`\"simt_only\"`"
msgstr "`\"unstructured_in_simt\"` (default), `\"simd\"`, `\"simt_only\"`"

msgid "控制 Ascend 950 上 SIMD / SIMT 编译路径。`\"simd\"`：纯 SIMD；`\"unstructured_in_simt\"`：混合（结构化 SIMD，离散/非结构化尽量走 SIMT 间接访存模板）；`\"simt_only\"`：纯 SIMT （`ttir→npubin`）。"
msgstr "Controls the SIMD/SIMT compilation path on Ascend 950. `\"simd\"`: pure SIMD; `\"unstructured_in_simt\"`: hybrid (structured SIMD, discrete/unstructured paths use SIMT indirect memory access templates as much as possible); `\"simt_only\"`: pure SIMT (`ttir→npubin`)."
